# Repository Licensing Agreement

This repository follows a multi-licensing (segmented) model to best suit the nature of the different assets hosted herein (documentation, data, and code) regarding Research Data Governance.

By contributing to, forks of, or utilizing this repository, you agree to comply with the terms specified below for each type of asset.

---

## 1. Documentation, Use Cases, and FAQs

All textual content, guides, case studies, governance frameworks, and Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs) are licensed under the **Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License (CC BY 4.0)**.

### Brief Summary of CC BY 4.0:
* **Share:** You are free to copy and redistribute the material in any medium or format.
* **Adapt:** You are free to remix, transform, and build upon the material for any purpose, even commercially.
* **Attribution:** You must give appropriate credit, provide a link to the license, and indicate if changes were made. 

The full legal text of the CC BY 4.0 license can be found officially at:
https://creativecommons.org

